WEBVTT

01:41.479 --> 01:45.970
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.680 --> 01:48.979
[Episode 27]

02:06.790 --> 02:07.510
Master.

02:24.800 --> 02:25.710
I have nothing to say to him.

02:26.040 --> 02:26.710
I'll just pretend to faint.

02:28.150 --> 02:28.710
Ranran!

02:32.870 --> 02:33.910
Your Highness, please rest assured.

02:34.560 --> 02:35.520
She should be fine.

02:36.840 --> 02:37.360
Servants!

02:37.430 --> 02:38.030
Yes.

02:42.840 --> 02:44.000
Quickly send her back to the Cool Breeze Palace.

02:44.079 --> 02:44.680
Yes.

02:50.960 --> 02:52.079
The Four-Way Waterways have been cleared.

02:53.190 --> 02:54.150
She's of no use anymore.

02:54.800 --> 02:56.280
When did you realize...

02:57.310 --> 02:57.910
I'm not her?

02:59.470 --> 03:01.400
To be honest, I found that something was wrong with you

03:01.960 --> 03:03.120
the first time I saw you.

03:03.960 --> 03:04.710
I was just blinded

03:04.710 --> 03:06.120
by the longing

03:08.000 --> 03:08.800
and expectations

03:09.840 --> 03:11.030
over the past 18 years.

03:12.850 --> 03:13.800
From the moment you entered the palace,

03:13.800 --> 03:14.800
you were full of flaws.

03:15.840 --> 03:17.360
You're nothing like Qingge.

03:18.660 --> 03:19.540
Even if you're deliberately pretending,

03:20.320 --> 03:21.150
it's not convincing.

03:22.030 --> 03:23.360
Luckily, what Su Yishui did

03:23.360 --> 03:24.190
made me realize

03:25.030 --> 03:27.030
that pushing you, this imposter, out to draw attention

03:27.380 --> 03:28.820
wasn't a bad idea.

03:30.280 --> 03:31.000
Otherwise, why do you think

03:31.000 --> 03:32.240
I would keep you around this long?

03:34.590 --> 03:35.960
Everything was a lie to me?

03:40.000 --> 03:40.840
Your kindness to me

03:42.310 --> 03:43.280
was also a lie?

03:45.280 --> 03:46.520
When you said you wanted to marry me,

03:47.750 --> 03:48.710
that was also a lie?

03:49.870 --> 03:50.590
What do you expect?

03:58.520 --> 03:59.430
Su Yu!

04:02.750 --> 04:03.960
I've been by your side

04:04.310 --> 04:05.560
longer than she was.

04:11.840 --> 04:12.870
And we were once

04:13.710 --> 04:14.960
very close.

04:16.160 --> 04:17.950
I took care of your daily life;

04:19.660 --> 04:21.300
you trusted me and were gentle with me.

04:23.070 --> 04:23.950
Have you forgotten?

04:29.190 --> 04:30.240
Even though I've made some mistakes

04:30.680 --> 04:32.120
and may have wronged others,

04:32.200 --> 04:34.090
I've given you

04:34.120 --> 04:35.390
all my heart!

04:39.720 --> 04:40.800
Can't you feel

04:43.070 --> 04:43.870
my love for you

04:44.110 --> 04:45.310
at all?

04:46.920 --> 04:47.510
Have you even

04:47.510 --> 04:49.240
moved yourself with your own words?

04:50.390 --> 04:51.750
I feel that, compared to me,

04:53.070 --> 04:54.400
you prefer the power

04:54.430 --> 04:55.600
I brought you.

04:56.610 --> 04:57.440
That's because...

04:58.000 --> 04:59.360
That's because I want to become stronger!

04:59.390 --> 05:00.510
I want to help you!

05:00.530 --> 05:02.120
You just want to achieve your own goals.

05:04.040 --> 05:05.750
And I'm just your best stepping stone.

05:10.500 --> 05:11.700
It's you...

05:13.000 --> 05:15.390
It's you who refuses to trust me.

05:21.980 --> 05:23.590
Even if what you said is true,

05:24.880 --> 05:25.760
so what?

05:27.510 --> 05:29.080
My heart has always

05:29.440 --> 05:30.440
belonged to Qingge.

05:31.320 --> 05:33.000
What do your feelings have to do with me?

05:43.510 --> 05:44.240
No need to keep her.

05:57.600 --> 05:58.630
Protect the Crown Prince!

06:07.600 --> 06:08.310
Are you alright?

06:08.510 --> 06:09.160
Don't be afraid.

06:09.510 --> 06:10.510
I took the Spiritual Power Token.

06:10.550 --> 06:11.400
I'll take you out of here!

06:11.520 --> 06:12.120
You...

06:12.640 --> 06:14.560
I spent a lot of money collecting many

06:14.580 --> 06:15.610
high-quality magical weapons before.

06:16.070 --> 06:17.190
Even if we have to use them all,

06:17.600 --> 06:19.070
we'll force our way out!

06:24.990 --> 06:25.560
Let's go!

06:34.000 --> 06:35.560
The esteemed guest's pulse is steady,

06:35.830 --> 06:36.800
and there's no major issue.

06:37.560 --> 06:38.120
No issue?

06:39.430 --> 06:40.800
Then why hasn't she woken up yet?

06:43.680 --> 06:44.190
Your Highness.

06:44.400 --> 06:45.000
Your Highness.

06:48.920 --> 06:49.920
I'm fine now.

06:50.710 --> 06:52.150
Your Highness, please go back and rest.

06:53.680 --> 06:54.790
Ranran, you're awake?

06:56.190 --> 06:57.270
Quick, help His Highness back to his chambers.

06:57.290 --> 06:58.090
Hurry up.

07:20.240 --> 07:21.770
How are the preparations going?

07:22.260 --> 07:23.460
Everything is ready.

07:24.160 --> 07:25.360
After the wedding ceremony the day after tomorrow,

07:25.750 --> 07:26.600
we will

07:27.030 --> 07:28.030
transfer your soul into a new mortal body.

07:29.720 --> 07:30.270
Good.

07:59.950 --> 08:01.480
Bai's spiritual power is weak after being injured,

08:02.040 --> 08:02.920
and the formation barrier

08:02.940 --> 08:04.180
has little effect on it.

08:05.190 --> 08:06.160
It's most suitable

08:06.440 --> 08:07.290
for sending messages in and out.

08:18.910 --> 08:20.750
Master is trapped in the body of the Green Dragon.

08:21.160 --> 08:22.000
On the Double Ninth Festival,

08:22.000 --> 08:22.800
he will break through the siege.

08:27.160 --> 08:28.080
How is he going to break through?

08:28.680 --> 08:29.590
What can we do?

08:31.750 --> 08:32.549
Everyone, look here.

08:34.169 --> 08:35.320
This is the palace defense formation map

08:35.320 --> 08:36.549
predicted by Ranran.

08:36.880 --> 08:38.830
This formation is formed by malicious energy.

08:39.549 --> 08:41.200
She marked several breakthrough points.

08:42.240 --> 08:43.360
These points are all along

08:43.630 --> 08:44.750
the outer edge of the palace walls

08:45.600 --> 08:46.480
and need us to break them.

08:46.960 --> 08:47.960
Using the formation-breaking talisman water,

08:47.980 --> 08:49.220
we should be able to break these points.

08:50.440 --> 08:51.680
The day after tomorrow is the Double Ninth Festival,

08:52.150 --> 08:53.390
and we must complete this task before then.

08:54.120 --> 08:55.000
But outside the imperial city,

08:55.000 --> 08:56.550
there are guards everywhere patrolling and keeping watch.

08:56.780 --> 08:58.690
The problem is how we can remain undetected.

08:59.400 --> 09:00.260
Perhaps...

09:01.440 --> 09:02.910
we don't have to do it ourselves.

09:05.120 --> 09:06.810
The mechanical puppet Mr. Zeng Yi taught me

09:06.840 --> 09:08.080
is driven by a mechanism

09:08.230 --> 09:09.440
and is unaffected by the formation.

09:09.650 --> 09:11.620
I can modify it into a mechanical bird.

09:11.650 --> 09:12.600
It can fly to the formation points,

09:13.000 --> 09:14.200
with the talisman water hidden inside,

09:14.250 --> 09:14.960
then scatter the water over the points.

09:15.240 --> 09:15.790
How about that?

09:17.630 --> 09:18.080
Not bad.

09:18.750 --> 09:19.440
Make a few more.

09:19.790 --> 09:21.000
Try to make them look like the birds

09:21.000 --> 09:21.600
that often fly outside the palace,

09:22.200 --> 09:22.960
so that they won't be discovered.

09:23.600 --> 09:24.120
Don't worry.

09:25.590 --> 09:26.670
There's still one problem.

09:27.630 --> 09:28.870
Ranran wants to find out

09:29.030 --> 09:30.720
the exact location of the core of this formation.

09:31.120 --> 09:32.030
Does anyone have any ideas?

09:32.630 --> 09:34.030
Ranran said this formation

09:34.030 --> 09:35.390
was formed by malicious energy.

09:36.000 --> 09:36.840
The core of the formation

09:37.080 --> 09:38.600
should be where the malicious energy is most intense.

09:39.550 --> 09:41.550
The surrounding soil and water are likely contaminated with malicious energy.

09:44.670 --> 09:45.600
I might have a way.

09:51.120 --> 09:51.600
How is it?

09:52.000 --> 09:53.390
Malicious energy has a unique foul, fishy smell,

09:53.630 --> 09:54.480
and I can smell it.

09:54.750 --> 09:55.570
The stronger the malicious energy,

09:55.600 --> 09:56.200
the stronger the smell

09:56.220 --> 09:57.220
in the surrounding soil and water.

09:57.720 --> 09:59.200
This way, I can locate the core of the formation.

10:00.480 --> 10:01.080
Can you do it?

10:01.630 --> 10:02.120
Don't worry.

10:02.600 --> 10:03.840
I'm using my Earth Spirit Root,

10:03.870 --> 10:04.550
my primal power,

10:05.000 --> 10:06.270
so I won't need to mobilize much spiritual power.

10:07.440 --> 10:08.720
I just need to take a bit of soil out.

10:08.870 --> 10:10.200
The defensive formation shouldn't detect it.

10:11.140 --> 10:12.380
Where should we start?

10:13.240 --> 10:14.120
Since all this mess

10:14.120 --> 10:15.360
was caused by the Crown Prince,

10:16.560 --> 10:17.090
let's start

10:17.120 --> 10:18.150
with his Jingyang Hall.

10:18.440 --> 10:18.840
Alright.

10:46.680 --> 10:47.940
This is the soil from beneath Jingyang Hall.

10:48.000 --> 10:48.600
Smell it.

10:58.870 --> 10:59.600
Is it?

11:02.150 --> 11:03.150
The smell is a bit faint.

11:03.170 --> 11:04.370
Let's try somewhere else.

11:05.610 --> 11:06.300
Okay.

11:25.280 --> 11:25.910
Go right.

11:47.030 --> 11:47.720
Let me smell it.

11:55.080 --> 11:55.600
Where is this from?

11:55.720 --> 11:56.510
That is the place.

11:57.200 --> 11:58.120
Madam Battle's Palace.

11:59.150 --> 12:00.360
So the core of the formation is here.

12:02.510 --> 12:03.080
Bai.

12:13.750 --> 12:14.270
Go.

12:26.390 --> 12:27.000
Master.

12:28.550 --> 12:29.120
Master?

12:31.630 --> 12:32.030
I'm here.

12:32.670 --> 12:33.270
Are you alright?

12:33.960 --> 12:35.440
So far, everything is going smoothly.

12:36.390 --> 12:37.000
It's just that...

12:39.240 --> 12:40.510
I miss you.

12:41.600 --> 12:42.630
This technique drains your energy.

12:43.080 --> 12:43.720
Don't use it too often.

12:44.440 --> 12:45.240
I have one thing

12:45.270 --> 12:46.390
I'd like to ask you.

12:47.240 --> 12:48.360
Tell me about

12:48.630 --> 12:50.190
the past between Su Yu and me

12:50.360 --> 12:51.440
when I was Mu Qingge.

12:55.200 --> 12:55.750
Master?

13:00.320 --> 13:01.240
Master, don't be upset.

13:01.930 --> 13:03.550
I just want to know my enemy,

13:03.790 --> 13:05.090
so I can find the right opportunity

13:05.120 --> 13:06.090
to stall Su Yu.

13:09.790 --> 13:11.870
Su Yu once gave you a meal,

13:12.790 --> 13:14.320
so you owe him a favor.

13:31.080 --> 13:32.010
So the core of the formation

13:32.270 --> 13:33.270
is at Madam Battle's Palace.

13:34.240 --> 13:34.720
Master,

13:35.240 --> 13:36.670
I'll use the Divine Tree to enter the core of the formation

13:36.870 --> 13:37.720
and try to break it.

13:38.270 --> 13:40.200
From now on, I won't be able to talk to you

13:40.200 --> 13:41.200
through the Divine Tree.

13:42.720 --> 13:43.200
We'll meet

13:43.440 --> 13:44.200
on the Double Ninth Festival.

13:44.790 --> 13:45.480
Take care of yourself

13:45.960 --> 13:46.390
and wait for me.

14:01.750 --> 14:02.670
Your Highness.

14:10.840 --> 14:12.550
The food here is awful.

14:12.790 --> 14:13.630
Who would eat this?

14:23.630 --> 14:24.670
If you want to eat anything,

14:25.150 --> 14:25.870
just say it.

14:26.360 --> 14:27.150
I'll have them make it.

14:27.550 --> 14:28.200
Forget it.

14:28.760 --> 14:30.510
They can't make the flavors I want.

14:30.960 --> 14:31.600
How about...

14:32.150 --> 14:33.390
you let me cook it myself,

14:34.080 --> 14:35.120
just like before?

14:37.270 --> 14:38.200
What before?

14:39.290 --> 14:40.390
I seem to remember

14:40.720 --> 14:41.510
that when you invited me

14:41.510 --> 14:43.080
to Prince Zong's residence in the past,

14:43.510 --> 14:44.790
you always reserved a kitchen

14:44.810 --> 14:45.810
for me to cook.

14:48.080 --> 14:48.670
Qingge,

14:49.840 --> 14:51.200
you remember those times with me now?

14:54.000 --> 14:55.510
I only vaguely remember a little.

14:57.680 --> 14:59.320
I was talking about me cooking.

14:59.670 --> 15:00.320
Don't interrupt.

15:03.550 --> 15:04.840
Once you move into the Eastern Palace,

15:06.030 --> 15:07.600
I'll have them build a kitchen

15:08.080 --> 15:08.910
and a wine cellar for you.

15:09.630 --> 15:10.200
What do you think?

15:10.870 --> 15:12.080
But not now?

15:12.910 --> 15:14.080
Are you still wary of me?

15:14.870 --> 15:15.720
But Su Yu,

15:16.380 --> 15:17.290
do you really think

15:17.320 --> 15:19.240
that after you forced me into marrying you

15:19.440 --> 15:20.910
with the lives of those people from Xue Village,

15:21.670 --> 15:22.760
I would just obediently accept it

15:22.790 --> 15:24.030
and live a peaceful life with you?

15:26.480 --> 15:27.960
Will promises for the future be of any use?

15:28.240 --> 15:29.750
Will you not need to be wary of me in the future?

15:32.360 --> 15:33.150
In the future...

15:34.960 --> 15:36.840
In the future, I will have plenty of time.

15:40.030 --> 15:40.840
You and I

15:42.390 --> 15:43.790
will naturally have a long future ahead.

16:00.480 --> 16:01.390
The auspicious time has come.

16:01.750 --> 16:03.390
Crown Princess,

16:03.600 --> 16:04.910
please go to Madam Battle's Palace

16:05.030 --> 16:05.840
to receive the imperial decree

16:06.120 --> 16:08.030
and perform the grand ceremony.

16:42.670 --> 16:43.840
It's not yet 12 PM.

17:07.000 --> 17:09.020
[Madam Battle's Palace]

17:29.480 --> 17:30.070
Ranran,

17:30.440 --> 17:31.750
you're walking a bit slow.

17:33.280 --> 17:35.280
Do you know that I've been waiting for this moment

17:35.920 --> 17:37.270
for nearly 20 years?

17:39.670 --> 17:41.190
Well, there's no rush for this moment.

17:44.110 --> 17:45.440
I built this Madam Battle's Palace

17:46.350 --> 17:47.720
for you.

17:48.550 --> 17:49.280
Today,

17:51.200 --> 17:52.960
it finally waited for the return of its master.

18:27.680 --> 18:29.200
He's been a part of our lives for half of them.

18:30.550 --> 18:31.920
Today, he will personally witness

18:31.950 --> 18:33.220
our grand wedding.

18:33.790 --> 18:34.680
It can be considered

18:35.160 --> 18:36.020
my final resolution

18:36.050 --> 18:36.860
for him.

18:39.790 --> 18:41.070
After our ceremony is complete,

18:42.040 --> 18:43.570
this body will be mine.

19:04.400 --> 19:05.780
In less than 15 minutes,

19:05.920 --> 19:07.000
it will be noon,

19:07.750 --> 19:09.350
and Master will be able to break through the Inquiry Pond.

19:10.830 --> 19:12.970
Perform the auspicious ceremony!

19:13.060 --> 19:14.900
Face southeast!

19:15.030 --> 19:17.920
Bow to the heavens and earth!

19:18.270 --> 19:19.110
Wait a moment.

19:20.000 --> 19:22.030
The world is vast, with so many directions.

19:22.440 --> 19:24.160
Why are we bowing only to the southeast?

19:24.790 --> 19:25.590
I don't think this is right.

19:30.310 --> 19:31.790
Then let's bow to all four directions,

19:32.750 --> 19:33.360
okay?

19:36.350 --> 19:36.880
Well...

19:39.480 --> 19:41.460
That seems more acceptable.

19:45.070 --> 19:46.350
Turn!

19:49.960 --> 19:51.240
Bow!

20:07.880 --> 20:08.830
Turn!

20:10.220 --> 20:11.780
Bow!

20:17.440 --> 20:18.720
Turn!

20:21.750 --> 20:23.270
Bow!

20:25.640 --> 20:27.030
Turn!

20:28.880 --> 20:30.400
Face north!

20:30.720 --> 20:34.000
Bow to His Majesty!

20:34.480 --> 20:35.440
With your parents here,

20:35.910 --> 20:37.390
if I don't personally meet them and bow to them,

20:37.880 --> 20:39.070
wouldn't that be disrespectful?

20:39.960 --> 20:40.640
Your Highness,

20:41.110 --> 20:42.750
how about you take me to meet His Majesty in person,

20:43.350 --> 20:44.160
so we can pay our respects to him?

20:45.440 --> 20:46.070
Ranran.

20:49.400 --> 20:50.160
Stop fooling around.

20:53.510 --> 20:54.510
Continue.

20:57.240 --> 20:58.760
Bow!

20:58.830 --> 20:59.400
Wait.

21:00.880 --> 21:01.470
Yu,

21:04.720 --> 21:05.720
I remember now.

21:06.480 --> 21:07.830
I've been here before.

21:08.240 --> 21:09.270
You said the palace

21:09.480 --> 21:11.170
received a tribute of fine wine from overseas

21:11.880 --> 21:13.310
and secretly brought me here to taste it.

21:15.640 --> 21:17.110
I remember that this place

21:17.400 --> 21:18.510
wasn't Madam Battle's Palace before.

21:19.240 --> 21:20.200
It was...

21:20.720 --> 21:21.270
a garden,

21:21.920 --> 21:22.440
right?

21:23.000 --> 21:23.680
That's right.

21:25.360 --> 21:26.410
I shared many thoughts with you

21:26.440 --> 21:27.440
back then.

21:28.440 --> 21:29.240
Do you remember?

21:31.790 --> 21:32.750
I only remember us

21:33.030 --> 21:34.270
laughing and chatting,

21:34.920 --> 21:35.960
happy and sincere.

21:36.440 --> 21:37.320
We used to be...

21:37.350 --> 21:38.480
We used to be good together, of course.

21:39.720 --> 21:41.000
But I've told you, Yu,

21:42.270 --> 21:43.720
I don't like being forced.

22:17.200 --> 22:17.790
Su Yu.

22:20.160 --> 22:21.270
I don't want to marry you.

22:22.110 --> 22:23.030
Xue Ranran,

22:25.200 --> 22:27.070
you actually used Mu Qingge to deceive me.

22:30.340 --> 22:31.440
Do you think Su Yishui

22:31.440 --> 22:32.920
can really escape my control?

22:49.750 --> 22:50.310
How could that be?

22:52.590 --> 22:53.680
You've been stalling

22:54.320 --> 22:55.170
because you want him

22:55.200 --> 22:56.640
to take the opportunity to break through the barrier,

22:57.000 --> 22:57.480
right?

22:58.830 --> 23:00.310
Do you really think I couldn't foresee this?

23:00.720 --> 23:02.280
Feng has already set up

23:02.310 --> 23:03.750
an immortal net over the imperial city.

23:04.010 --> 23:04.800
If his first strike fails,

23:04.830 --> 23:06.000
he will be trapped by the net.

23:06.590 --> 23:07.870
He has nowhere to run now.

23:09.660 --> 23:10.830
Let's not waste any more time.

23:11.640 --> 23:12.590
Continue with the ceremony.

23:12.960 --> 23:13.600
Let go!

23:13.830 --> 23:14.880
Don't hurt my master!

23:20.400 --> 23:21.000
Ranran,

23:21.680 --> 23:22.920
this is the end.

23:23.960 --> 23:25.270
You have to accept it whether you like it or not.

23:26.790 --> 23:28.240
Su Yishui won't escape.

23:29.010 --> 23:30.040
His body is mine.

23:30.070 --> 23:31.400
And so are you!

23:36.030 --> 23:37.030
Didn't you want me

23:37.030 --> 23:38.750
to marry you with my own face?

23:39.720 --> 23:41.360
Let's complete the ceremony now

23:42.210 --> 23:43.210
and fulfill the final wish

23:43.240 --> 23:44.240
of this body.

23:44.790 --> 23:45.240
Come on!

23:46.110 --> 23:47.240
Let's perform the bowing ritual!

23:48.720 --> 23:49.920
Who said I have no backup plan?

23:58.920 --> 24:00.000
The defensive formation has been destroyed from underground!

24:01.960 --> 24:02.880
Explore the underground?

24:03.750 --> 24:04.640
Su Yu might

24:04.910 --> 24:06.210
be able to figure out my plan.

24:06.400 --> 24:07.200
He'll definitely take precautions.

24:07.680 --> 24:08.920
The foundation of the palace's defense formation

24:08.920 --> 24:09.640
is underground.

24:10.060 --> 24:11.230
If we can find the core

24:11.560 --> 24:12.820
and completely destroy the formation...

24:13.310 --> 24:14.400
Our spiritual power

24:14.400 --> 24:15.480
won't be suppressed anymore.

24:15.720 --> 24:16.550
It's a permanent solution.

24:17.680 --> 24:18.710
I can use my spiritual power now.

24:35.030 --> 24:36.030
Hurry up and exchange our bodies!

25:02.270 --> 25:03.410
Master, your mortal body!

25:03.510 --> 25:04.480
Let's go back now!

25:04.960 --> 25:06.240
Let me send you to a safe place first.

25:07.030 --> 25:08.070
It would be too late by then!

25:08.550 --> 25:09.160
Ranran!

25:30.880 --> 25:32.110
Use the magical weapons to suppress him!

25:40.240 --> 25:41.350
Master, don't worry about me!

25:41.590 --> 25:42.750
Hurry up and take back your mortal body!

25:43.310 --> 25:44.030
You are more important!

26:01.070 --> 26:02.240
The original spiritual power

26:02.400 --> 26:03.720
of this body was preserved.

26:04.880 --> 26:05.880
I'm quite satisfied.

26:05.960 --> 26:06.720
Master,

26:07.160 --> 26:08.070
let's knock him out

26:08.090 --> 26:09.280
and directly take your body.

26:26.130 --> 26:27.040
What's happening?

26:27.310 --> 26:27.880
Master!

26:28.590 --> 26:30.160
This Green Dragon was raised by me.

26:30.440 --> 26:31.480
To tame it,

26:31.750 --> 26:33.110
I used quite a few methods.

26:35.300 --> 26:36.370
Like burying some talismans

26:36.400 --> 26:37.480
inside its body

26:37.640 --> 26:38.960
to better control it.

26:40.440 --> 26:41.240
Xue Ranran,

26:42.400 --> 26:44.960
this body is mine now.

26:45.480 --> 26:46.790
Su Yishui won't come back.

26:49.480 --> 26:50.370
You wish!

26:52.730 --> 26:54.290
Our wedding ceremony hasn't been completed yet.

26:54.590 --> 26:55.160
Come here!

27:03.070 --> 27:03.640
Oh no.

27:07.720 --> 27:09.000
Master was using the spiritual power of his Golden Core

27:09.000 --> 27:09.920
to suppress the Spirit Spring.

27:10.590 --> 27:12.030
Now, with all this commotion,

27:12.110 --> 27:13.550
this body's spiritual power has become unstable.

27:13.660 --> 27:15.350
The Spirit Spring naturally wants to take the opportunity to break free,

27:15.720 --> 27:17.000
shattering the Heavenly Bottle.

27:26.720 --> 27:28.400
I can finally come out.

27:28.880 --> 27:30.240
I'm going to be free!

27:31.170 --> 27:32.480
The body of the Demon's child

27:32.510 --> 27:34.030
is the one most suited to me!

27:35.550 --> 27:36.070
No!

27:36.350 --> 27:37.110
Don't!

27:50.880 --> 27:51.440
Ranran.

27:52.240 --> 27:53.110
Ranran, be careful!

27:54.400 --> 27:54.960
Ranran!

27:56.110 --> 27:56.920
Ranran, be careful!

28:01.190 --> 28:02.150
Su Yu, wake up!

28:02.960 --> 28:04.400
You've gone to great lengths to take over my body.

28:05.000 --> 28:06.020
Are you really going to accept it?

28:19.720 --> 28:21.270
Get out of my master's body!

28:22.640 --> 28:23.400
Ranran, don't!

28:23.960 --> 28:24.510
Su Yu?

28:29.000 --> 28:30.350
Anyone who ruins my plans

28:30.750 --> 28:31.740
deserves to die!

28:57.470 --> 28:58.270
The golden talisman is not working.

28:58.590 --> 28:59.240
What should I do?

29:00.180 --> 29:01.180
Don't you dare hurt her again!

29:05.680 --> 29:06.110
Ranran!

29:06.440 --> 29:07.110
The Vermilion Bird's blood!

29:07.540 --> 29:08.030
Right.

29:08.550 --> 29:10.200
The Vermilion Bird is a sacred object for exorcising demons.

29:11.510 --> 29:12.220
Little Vermilion Bird,

29:12.250 --> 29:12.880
could you let me

29:12.900 --> 29:14.050
take some of your blood?

30:19.310 --> 30:20.240
Ranran!

30:28.400 --> 30:29.070
Ranran!

30:30.310 --> 30:31.240
Ranran!

31:24.320 --> 31:24.980
Oh no.

31:25.240 --> 31:26.070
His primordial spirit is about to dissipate.

31:28.790 --> 31:29.920
Change the formation, pursue his spirit,

31:30.110 --> 31:31.160
and let his primordial spirit return!

31:53.490 --> 31:56.310
[Somewhere near the East Sea]

32:24.550 --> 32:25.640
Is Master's body

32:26.160 --> 32:27.750
still possessed by Su Yu?

32:30.110 --> 32:30.640
Oh no.

32:31.070 --> 32:32.310
All the golden talismans and elixirs on me

32:32.310 --> 32:33.030
are gone.

32:37.400 --> 32:38.030
Who are you?

32:38.510 --> 32:39.000
Don't move.

32:39.640 --> 32:40.830
You took the collision of demonic energy

32:40.830 --> 32:41.510
without even trying to dodge.

32:41.750 --> 32:42.550
Your bones are cracked.

32:42.880 --> 32:44.200
Do you want to be bedridden for the rest of your life?

32:44.510 --> 32:45.240
Su Yu,

32:45.650 --> 32:47.480
give my master's body back to him.

32:47.830 --> 32:49.030
I'll give you anything you want.

32:49.310 --> 32:50.840
I'll even marry you if that's what you want.

32:51.350 --> 32:52.720
If you want to be reborn,

32:53.270 --> 32:54.720
I'll give you my body.

32:54.960 --> 32:55.590
How?

33:01.350 --> 33:02.400
Haven't I told you that

33:02.710 --> 33:03.370
you must not

33:03.400 --> 33:04.440
sacrifice yourself for anyone?

33:07.440 --> 33:08.110
Master,

33:08.510 --> 33:09.350
it's you!

33:09.880 --> 33:11.160
I've brought you back.

33:11.690 --> 33:13.100
And you want to give your body to Su Yu?

33:13.720 --> 33:14.960
It's just a temporary measure.

33:15.350 --> 33:16.350
It's to lower his guard

33:16.430 --> 33:17.430
so I'll have time to find a way.

33:18.030 --> 33:19.240
Master, you're back.

33:20.400 --> 33:21.190
It's so wonderful.

33:33.690 --> 33:38.150
♫After parting, the black silk-like hair turned snow-white♫

33:35.480 --> 33:36.680
The Vermilion Bird's blood you gave me

33:36.680 --> 33:37.270
was very effective.

33:37.880 --> 33:39.160
It suppressed the demonic energy of the Spirit Spring.

33:38.800 --> 33:43.920
♫In secret, I've been missing you, dreaming about you for years♫

33:39.680 --> 33:40.510
As for Su Yu,

33:40.880 --> 33:41.880
he failed in taking over my body,

33:41.960 --> 33:42.720
so his foundation was unstable.

33:42.960 --> 33:44.200
The Vermilion Bird's blood treated his primordial spirit

33:44.000 --> 33:49.080
♫Awaiting the destined love, a déjà vu so real♫

33:44.270 --> 33:44.880
as an evil being

33:44.880 --> 33:45.590
and drove it out.

33:47.830 --> 33:48.590
Stop crying.

33:49.320 --> 33:56.370
♫I'd trade three lifetimes of grandeur for your one fleeting bliss♫

33:53.650 --> 33:54.650
The Spirit Spring is still inside.

33:57.800 --> 34:02.220
♫Gradually gravitate toward you by love♫

34:03.030 --> 34:08.120
♫Words are too weak to tell the whole story♫

34:03.640 --> 34:04.960
I just got a bit close to you.

34:05.310 --> 34:06.200
Why did you move away?

34:06.450 --> 34:07.680
You were quite decisive

34:07.680 --> 34:08.400
when you kissed Su Yu.

34:08.139 --> 34:12.929
♫Only after I met you♫

34:08.670 --> 34:09.670
Kiss?

34:10.409 --> 34:11.199
That was me

34:11.230 --> 34:12.320
forcing the Spirit Spring out

34:12.320 --> 34:13.550
by feeding him Vermilion Bird's blood.

34:13.250 --> 34:21.070
♫Did I realize there are heaven-like places all because of you♫

34:14.110 --> 34:14.800
Besides,

34:15.030 --> 34:16.030
that was your mouth.

34:16.670 --> 34:17.400
Even if it was a kiss,

34:18.020 --> 34:19.270
it was between me and...

34:21.340 --> 34:26.360
♫Maybe a lifetime is too short, too fleeting♫

34:26.380 --> 34:31.620
♫So we were granted a second chance♫

34:32.070 --> 34:37.040
♫With endless time to write our story♫

34:37.300 --> 34:41.420
♫We fulfill the vow forged through many lifetimes♫

34:41.699 --> 34:47.060
♫From now onwards♫

34:53.920 --> 34:54.590
I shouldn't have...

34:56.080 --> 34:56.929
Shouldn't have what?

34:57.830 --> 34:59.790
Are you going to do the same thing you did at the Wester Sect—

35:00.440 --> 35:02.030
pushing me away even though

35:02.630 --> 35:04.280
we feel the same way?

35:05.070 --> 35:07.030
You always make decisions on your own,

35:07.110 --> 35:08.150
but never ask me.

35:09.230 --> 35:10.400
But in the end,

35:10.400 --> 35:11.550
I still got involved.

35:12.150 --> 35:13.360
Master, have you ever thought about

35:13.630 --> 35:14.480
how you would handle this

35:14.880 --> 35:16.800
if I hadn't come?

35:21.440 --> 35:22.760
I've already cast a spell on myself.

35:23.400 --> 35:24.990
The Spirit Spring has long been bound to my body.

35:26.320 --> 35:27.630
No matter what happens,

35:28.210 --> 35:29.570
even if the Spirit Spring takes over this body,

35:30.550 --> 35:31.550
my mortal body and Golden Core

35:31.710 --> 35:32.430
will both become

35:32.430 --> 35:33.670
the vessel sealing it.

35:34.960 --> 35:36.320
Afterward, Zeng Yi will find him,

35:36.970 --> 35:38.420
and once the entrance to the netherworld opens,

35:38.450 --> 35:39.530
he will seal him back in there.

35:40.320 --> 35:41.000
This matter

35:41.630 --> 35:42.280
must end with me,

35:42.280 --> 35:43.550
no matter what.

35:46.710 --> 35:47.320
Ranran.

35:50.940 --> 35:51.740
Right now,

35:52.110 --> 35:53.670
my heart feels like it's breaking.

35:54.550 --> 35:55.710
Master, you've planned

35:56.000 --> 35:57.070
everything so well,

35:57.840 --> 35:59.880
but why have you never considered my feelings?

36:05.030 --> 36:06.320
My fate in this life is already sealed.

36:06.920 --> 36:08.030
You shouldn't be dragged down by me.

36:08.600 --> 36:09.590
What do you mean by sealed?

36:10.110 --> 36:11.070
If something happens to you,

36:11.470 --> 36:13.070
I'll only spend the rest of my life

36:13.090 --> 36:14.010
in sadness and regret.

36:14.240 --> 36:15.720
I'll never live

36:16.400 --> 36:17.000
freely and happily

36:17.060 --> 36:17.810
on my own

36:17.840 --> 36:18.880
like you want.

36:19.840 --> 36:20.400
Now,

36:20.840 --> 36:21.960
I already know everything and am involved.

36:22.460 --> 36:23.870
Don't even think about pushing me away.

36:25.760 --> 36:26.400
Master,

36:27.000 --> 36:28.230
I'll go to the netherworld with you

36:28.230 --> 36:29.000
to seal the Spirit Spring.

36:29.440 --> 36:30.590
After we seal it,

36:30.920 --> 36:32.110
let's live a good life together,

36:32.130 --> 36:32.860
okay?

36:35.150 --> 36:37.150
Why don't you have the courage to promise me?

36:39.380 --> 36:41.220
Because, even though you're fine now,

36:41.890 --> 36:42.560
Master,

36:43.960 --> 36:45.280
once you go to the netherworld,

36:46.360 --> 36:48.280
you'll still give up your mortal body and Golden Core

36:48.550 --> 36:50.110
to seal the Spirit Spring, right?

36:51.380 --> 36:52.770
Is this the "sealed fate"

36:52.800 --> 36:54.320
you mentioned?

36:55.760 --> 36:57.440
You always carry everything on your own

36:57.870 --> 36:59.540
and never want to tell me anything.

37:00.000 --> 37:00.800
Is it because

37:01.680 --> 37:02.600
I, Xue Ranran,

37:02.630 --> 37:04.070
who don't remember the past,

37:04.840 --> 37:05.920
am just being delusional

37:05.940 --> 37:06.860
with one-sided hopes

37:07.400 --> 37:08.440
and don't deserve

37:09.290 --> 37:10.040
to face hardship with you

37:10.070 --> 37:11.400
in your heart?

37:12.070 --> 37:12.800
Of course not.

37:14.510 --> 37:15.030
Ranran,

37:15.670 --> 37:16.280
you've forgotten

37:16.300 --> 37:17.340
what I used to be like.

37:18.360 --> 37:19.480
I was ruthless and cold,

37:19.600 --> 37:20.450
not kind at all.

37:21.540 --> 37:22.820
I've experienced trust and hatred,

37:23.480 --> 37:25.150
but in the end, all that was left was deep regret.

37:26.750 --> 37:27.830
To this day, I still don't know

37:28.270 --> 37:29.750
if everything Mu Qingge did for me

37:30.400 --> 37:31.510
was out of love

37:32.000 --> 37:33.030
or righteousness.

37:34.110 --> 37:35.110
But no matter what,

37:36.070 --> 37:37.400
I was the one who killed you.

37:39.960 --> 37:40.840
Did you

37:42.550 --> 37:44.150
truly have the intention to kill me back then?

37:45.700 --> 37:46.610
I had no intention to kill you.

37:47.550 --> 37:48.320
But I fell into

37:48.320 --> 37:49.480
Mu Ranwu's trap,

37:50.630 --> 37:51.670
helplessly watching...

37:55.000 --> 37:55.710
How could someone like me

37:56.350 --> 37:57.590
dare to ask for anything?

37:58.760 --> 38:00.110
I hate myself more than anything.

38:01.510 --> 38:02.190
Master...

38:05.670 --> 38:06.710
I originally just wanted

38:07.400 --> 38:08.480
to exchange my life for yours,

38:09.230 --> 38:10.190
repaying what I owe you.

38:10.880 --> 38:12.110
No matter how you want to take revenge on me,

38:12.130 --> 38:12.940
I am willing to accept it.

38:14.510 --> 38:15.070
But Mu Ranwu

38:15.090 --> 38:16.300
cast a Soul-Devouring Lock on you,

38:16.900 --> 38:17.970
and you forgot everything.

38:19.400 --> 38:20.840
So my plan was to stay by your side first,

38:21.480 --> 38:23.070
helping you rid yourself of the threat of the Soul-Devouring Lock,

38:24.590 --> 38:25.630
until you became stronger

38:25.960 --> 38:27.440
and could protect yourself for a lifetime.

38:28.010 --> 38:29.130
Only then would I go and deal with the Spirit Spring,

38:29.320 --> 38:30.230
eliminating any future risks.

38:32.600 --> 38:34.520
You and I are destined to part ways.

38:36.520 --> 38:37.210
I've always

38:38.320 --> 38:39.840
known this in my heart.

38:41.150 --> 38:42.550
But being with you day and night,

38:44.110 --> 38:45.590
I couldn't help but fall for you.

38:47.400 --> 38:48.960
You finally admitted it.

38:51.450 --> 38:53.380
It's inevitable that I will return to the netherworld and seal the Spirit Spring;

38:54.280 --> 38:55.030
this cannot be changed.

38:56.350 --> 38:56.910
Ranran,

38:58.750 --> 39:00.230
there will be no future between us.

39:01.660 --> 39:02.180
No.

39:03.310 --> 39:04.190
I don't accept that.

39:04.760 --> 39:05.400
I will...

39:06.110 --> 39:06.920
I must...

39:07.510 --> 39:08.190
Ranran...

39:11.820 --> 39:12.740
I must

39:13.780 --> 39:15.420
change the ending you mentioned.

39:17.000 --> 39:18.120
Master, stop moving.

39:20.320 --> 39:21.000
What are you doing?

39:21.630 --> 39:22.840
To trap you,

39:23.420 --> 39:24.440
I've already linked the Divine Tree

39:24.490 --> 39:25.740
with my spiritual power.

39:26.440 --> 39:27.590
If the Divine Tree is broken,

39:28.120 --> 39:28.890
my spiritual power

39:29.150 --> 39:30.070
will completely dissipate.

39:30.760 --> 39:31.280
You...

39:40.600 --> 39:42.370
As long as your spiritual soul is restored,

39:42.920 --> 39:44.840
your Golden Core will be fully repaired,

39:45.070 --> 39:46.280
and you'll ascend to the Transcendence Realm.

39:46.890 --> 39:48.440
That way, you won't need to sacrifice your life

39:48.640 --> 39:49.930
to seal the Spirit Spring.

39:50.250 --> 39:50.930
Impossible.

39:51.440 --> 39:52.760
Even Liang Wumeng can't do it,

39:52.920 --> 39:53.590
how could you?

39:54.360 --> 39:55.760
What dangerous method will you use this time?

39:55.790 --> 39:56.980
It will surely harm you,

39:57.360 --> 39:58.320
and it won't succeed.

39:59.150 --> 40:01.110
The Xuantian Teachings clearly state

40:01.480 --> 40:02.760
that using my Formless Spirit Root

40:03.260 --> 40:04.570
gives a very high chance of success.

40:12.150 --> 40:13.110
Ranran, stop it!

40:13.630 --> 40:14.070
Alright.

40:14.280 --> 40:14.960
I promise you

40:15.240 --> 40:16.470
that I will allow you to return your spiritual soul.

40:16.960 --> 40:18.150
But your injuries aren't healed yet.

40:18.370 --> 40:19.480
Let's wait until you've fully recovered,

40:19.840 --> 40:20.440
alright?

40:20.880 --> 40:21.550
It doesn't matter.

40:22.480 --> 40:24.360
Master, you don't need to delay it.

40:24.870 --> 40:25.910
Then what's the cost?

40:26.880 --> 40:28.190
Will it harm your Formless Spirit Root

40:28.450 --> 40:29.420
or your body?

40:29.930 --> 40:30.810
It's not worth it at all.

40:31.230 --> 40:32.000
Do you know that in my heart,

40:32.000 --> 40:33.280
there's a drop of the Spirit Spring that can't be removed?

40:33.820 --> 40:35.300
Even if I return safely from the netherworld,

40:35.630 --> 40:36.840
I might still turn demonic in the future.

40:37.120 --> 40:38.250
Do you want to repeat the same mistake?

40:39.090 --> 40:40.300
Don't worry, Master.

40:40.610 --> 40:41.650
It won't cost me my life.

40:42.160 --> 40:43.370
It's just using the Formless Spirit Root

40:43.760 --> 40:45.110
in exchange for you not having to die.

40:45.920 --> 40:47.360
Besides, the Xuantian Teachings state

40:47.800 --> 40:49.720
that after you attain the power of the Transcendence Realm,

40:50.320 --> 40:51.510
you can use the Heavenly Bottle

40:51.800 --> 40:53.360
to draw out that drop of the Spirit Spring in your heart

40:53.630 --> 40:54.510
and seal it,

40:54.630 --> 40:55.550
eliminating any future risks.

40:56.340 --> 40:57.610
It's worth it in any case.

41:07.070 --> 41:08.000
If you destroy your Spirit Root,

41:08.280 --> 41:09.320
your spiritual power will dissipate.

41:10.480 --> 41:11.590
All the suffering you endured during your past cultivation

41:11.590 --> 41:12.440
will be in vain.

41:12.560 --> 41:13.600
And you won't be able to cultivate again.

41:14.280 --> 41:15.360
You will become more vulnerable

41:15.360 --> 41:16.150
than ordinary people.

41:17.190 --> 41:18.190
It's not worth it at all.

41:18.960 --> 41:19.670
I revived you

41:20.050 --> 41:20.730
so that in this life,

41:20.760 --> 41:22.070
you could live freely for yourself.

41:22.680 --> 41:23.560
I won't allow you

41:23.590 --> 41:24.480
to sacrifice so much for someone

41:24.670 --> 41:25.590
who once hurt and betrayed you.

41:25.880 --> 41:27.000
But I want

41:28.000 --> 41:29.480
to spend this life growing old...

41:30.190 --> 41:30.800
with you.

41:35.390 --> 41:36.620
Go back, Ling Xiao.

41:37.190 --> 41:38.190
Thank you

41:38.720 --> 41:39.590
for all these years.

42:35.250 --> 42:35.960
Ranran.

42:37.030 --> 42:37.800
Master,

42:38.440 --> 42:40.300
you've ascended to the Transcendence Realm.
